# Build-context hygiene for the production images.
#
# The images copy source only: local databases, build output, editor state and
# secrets are never part of a build. Keeping node_modules and dist out also
# means a stale local build cannot leak into an image layer.
.git
.github
.gitignore
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
data
**/data
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*
.env.example
**/.env.example
.remember
**/.remember
.zcode
**/.zcode
.superpowers
**/.superpowers
docs/superpowers
test-results
coverage
